 "chunks": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.568,
   "text": "Imagine turning a FEW HUNDRED dollars"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 2.568,
   "end": 3.052,
   "text": "into MILLIONS."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 3.212,
   "end": 4.415,
   "text": "That's the kind of DREAM"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 4.415,
   "end": 6.863,
   "text": "that made a crypto trader known as KIMCHI"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 6.863,
   "end": 7.799,
   "text": "FAMOUS online."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 10.1,
   "end": 13.791,
   "text": "Kimchi says he started trading MEMECOINS in 2024."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 13.951,
   "end": 16.663,
   "text": "Those are cryptocurrencies that can EXPLODE in price"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 16.663,
   "end": 17.812,
   "text": "from INTERNET HYPE."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 17.972,
   "end": 19.764,
   "text": "But they can also CRASH in SECONDS."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 20.114,
   "end": 22.043,
   "text": "In JANUARY 2025,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 22.043,
   "end": 23.378,
   "text": "the TRUMP memecoin LAUNCHED."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 23.538,
   "end": 25.771,
   "text": "Its price SKYROCKETED in just TWO DAYS,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 25.771,
   "end": 28.253,
   "text": "and Kimchi REPORTEDLY made millions."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 30.1,
   "end": 32.474,
   "text": "Some reports CLAIMED he made an astonishing"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 32.474,
   "end": 34.687,
   "text": "$40 MILLION trading TRUMP."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 34.847,
   "end": 36.359,
   "text": "But that number has NEVER been"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 36.359,
   "end": 37.919,
   "text": "INDEPENDENTLY VERIFIED."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 40.1,
   "end": 41.743,
   "text": "And here's what most people FORGET."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 41.903,
   "end": 44.804,
   "text": "TRUMP later FELL about 98% from its peak."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 44.964,
   "end": 46.273,
   "text": "For every SUCCESS story,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 46.273,
   "end": 47.844,
   "text": "many traders LOSE MONEY."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 50.1,
   "end": 52.639,
   "text": "Kimchi's story shows how FAST fortunes change."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 52.799,
   "end": 54.292,
   "text": "But success ISN'T GUARANTEED."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
